Package: plugin-db-qualification-rpi5-zynthian-vangelis
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plugin-qualify (>= 0.19.0~), plugin-qualify (<< 0.20~)
Description: plugin-db qualification layer: zynthian-vangelis set for rpi5
 The qualification layer of the plugin database for one machine class and one
 plugin set: the plugin-qualify records of the zynthian-vangelis plugin set,
 measured on a Raspberry Pi 5 (host class rpi5). plugin-qualify-sync takes a
 plugin from them instead of measuring it, and only when every file of the
 installed plugin hashes as the measured one did; any other plugin is
 measured on the device as before.
